// WMI Backdoor Exchange Transport Agent | T1546.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_wmi_backdoor_exchange_transport_agent.yml
process.parent.executable.caseless:*\\EdgeTransport.exe AND (NOT (process.executable.caseless:C\:\\Windows\\System32\\conhost.exe OR (process.executable.caseless:C\:\\Program\ Files\\Microsoft\\Exchange\ Server\\* AND process.executable.caseless:*\\Bin\\OleConverter.exe)))
